    "description": {
      "value": "You accelerate the processes of decay in the area. Each living creature in the area takes 2d10 negative damage (basic Fortitude save). A creature afflicted by a disease takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to this save.\n\nYou can also direct the blight to rot all Small and Tiny non-creature plants in the area, eliminating non-magical undergrowth and any resulting difficult terrain, cover, and concealment. Sudden blight attempts to counteract any magical effect on the plants before withering them."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 1d10."
    },
